    "Diagnose the performance gap for {who}: {gap}, given what's been tried: {done}. Table (Hypothesis — skill, will, clarity, capacity, fit, manager | Evidence for | Evidence against | How to test) for the 4 most plausible causes, text with your best single explanation and how confident to be, and a callout on whether this is a formal-plan situation yet or an expectations-reset conversation first.",
