    "Run the weekly plan check-in for {who} from: {week}. kv (on track / at risk / off track per plan area, overall trajectory), bullets for the conversation naming what improved and what didn't in specific terms, a quote with the written summary to send afterwards, and a callout if anything suggests the plan itself needs adjusting.",
